    ap:rationale "Michelson-Morley's null result for an aether-drift is naturally explained by SR without ad hoc auxiliary contraction (FitzGerald-Lorentz)." .

d:citation-lorentz a ap:Citation ;
    ap:id d:citation-lorentz ; ap:paper d:paper-relativity-1920 ;
