    ap:rationale "Newcomb's 1895 reanalysis confirmed the residual ~43''/century perihelion shift to within a few arc-seconds." .

d:citation-eddington a ap:Citation ;
    ap:id d:citation-eddington ; ap:paper d:paper-relativity-1920 ;
